.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH trellis-doctor 1 "" trellis "Trellis Manual"
.SH NAME
trellis\-doctor \- Validate workspace invariants; non\-zero exit on any error
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtrellis doctor\fR [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-directory\fR] [\fB\-\-fix\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validate workspace invariants; non\-zero exit on any error
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-directory\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Run as if started in this directory
.TP
\fB\-\-fix\fR
Apply the mechanically\-fixable findings (seed changelog stubs, patch stale locked versions), then re\-report what remains
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
List the fixes `\-\-fix` would apply without writing anything
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
